{"id":"1-4-butanediol","name":"1,4-Butanediol","form":"dropper","status":"Well-documented","aliases":"bd, 1,4-bd, 14bd","category":"Depressant","chemicalClass":"Alkanediol, Diol","psychoactiveClass":"Depressant","halfLife":"39.3 minutes +/- 11 minutes.","addictionPotential":"moderately physically and psychologically addictive","toxicity":["exact toxic dosage is unknown"],"summarySources":"PsychonautWiki, TripSit","summary":"1,4-BD is a clear liquid with intoxicating effects. It is a pro-drug for GHB, and has similar though reportedly inferior effects. It also carries the potential for more health risks than GHB, such as liver toxicity.","advisory":"Avoid: All other CNS depressants.","doseMaxTick":6,"doseUnit":"mL","doseRows":[{"roa":"Oral","source":"PsychonautWiki","unit":"mL","threshold":"0.5 mL","light":"0.5–1 mL","common":"1–2.5 mL","strong":"2.5–4 mL","heavy":"4 mL+","commonEstimate":1.75,"band":{"low":1,"high":2.5},"domain":[0.4,5.5],"segments":{"light":[0.5,1],"common":[1,2.5],"strong":[2.5,4],"heavy":[4,5.28]}}],"durationSources":"PsychonautWiki, TripSit","durationRows":[{"roa":"Oral","onset":"20–60 min","comeup":"—","peak":"1–2 h","offset":"1.5–2 h","afterEffects":"2–4 h","total":"3–5 h"}],"tolerance":{"buildUp":"within several weeks of continuous use","reset":"7 - 14 days","milestones":[{"label":"Full tolerance","value":"within several weeks of continuous use","tone":"danger"},{"label":"Baseline","value":"7 - 14 days","tone":"positive"}],"crossTolerances":[]},"subjectiveEffects":[{"name":"Amnesia","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Amnesia"},{"name":"Anxiety suppression","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Anxiety_suppression"},{"name":"Cognitive euphoria","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Cognitive_euphoria"},{"name":"Dehydration","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Dehydration"},{"name":"Disinhibition","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Disinhibition"},{"name":"Dizziness","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Dizziness"},{"name":"Empat